# Null start code packets (ANSI E1.11): a 0x00, then levels. A record is
# `octets => meaning`; the meaning lists every non-zero slot as
# address=level, one-based as a console numbers them, or `dark`.

# A full universe, every slot 0: what a console sends on blackout.
